    "A": "½($\\ aL^{2} + bL^{3})$",
    "B": "$\\frac{1}{3}$($\\ aL^{2} + bL^{3})$",
    "C": "($\\frac{aL^{2}}{2} + \\frac{bL^{3}}{6})$",
    "D": "($\\frac{aL^{2}}{2} + \\frac{bL^{3}}{3})$"
  },
